# Auspicious Arrival: "Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Investigate." Bot1 casts it on Bot2's Ornithopter (any creature may be the
# target, not only its own): the 0/2 is 2/4 until end of turn and Bot1, the caster, makes the Clue. The pump ends with the turn (Bot2's
# Ornithopter is 0/2 again on turn 2), the Clue stays. Played at instant speed in Bot1's own combat it needs no sorcery timing.

